WEBVTT

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.980
Today is a holiday!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.430
I forgot about it!

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.790
Good morning, Yunocchi.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.190
Oh, Miya-chan, good morning.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:52.760
You're working hard this morning. Very good.

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.530
I was sweeping my entrance
and wound up here.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.160
I figured I should do this area as well.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:03.140
It sure is easy to wake up early on a holiday.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.640
That's because it's such a waste
to stay under the covers.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:10.940
Oh, it's Ms. Yoshinoya!

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:12.620
Hidamari Apartments

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.350
Hidamari Apartments
You're right.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:13.520
You're right.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.450
Ms. Yoshinoya!

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:19.580
Oh, Miyako, Yuno.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.490
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.330
Question, question, question,
question, question mark

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:32.700
Lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing about

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.640
What should we do?

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:39.810
For now, let's just yell "Wasshoi!"

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.350
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:42.750
Wa! Shoi!

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.420
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:51.420
Even an absurd response

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.330
Is sensible for someone from Jupiter

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.430
Launch a rocket at random

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:59.260
And approach the place where it lands

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:03.930
After a pleasant nap

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:08.340
Sure enough, sure enough,
my eyes tear when I yawn

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.510
Good morning

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:10.680
Let's play!

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:13.380
Let's have a serious bread-eating race

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:14.510
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.050
Who, who, who, who, who is it?

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:20.390
Hungry, hungry, hungry,
hungry, hungry person

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:24.790
Girls live off snacks

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.560
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!
Rolling, rolling, rolling, golfing around

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.360
Rolling, rolling, rolling, golfing around

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:30.700
Lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing about

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:34.600
Let's look up at the sun

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.870
Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:40.410
In a dream, in a dream with everyone
Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:42.970
I had the same conversation

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.880
Question mark and washoi 365

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.680
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.550
May 27, Guardian Monster

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:59.300
I'm pretty sure there were
billboards at the station,

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.570
so I don't think it's that far away.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.470
Well, if you get lost, give us a call.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:06.800
Okay! Thank you very much.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.670
Be careful, you two.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.110
We'll be off.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:20.860
Yuno! Hurry up!

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:21.090
Tak

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:21.360
Tak
Tak

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.830
Okay.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.300
Want to hold on to a strap?

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.110
No, I'm fine.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.070
Klank Clunk Klank Clunk

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:39.140
I find that it's easy to withstand
the train's movements,

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:42.580
if I plant my feet firmly on the ground
and stand diagonally.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.910
Oh? I'll try it too!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:50.880
Miss Yuno! If you squat a little,
you'll be more stable!

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.390
Huh? Oh, you're right!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:54.720
Umm...

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:55.890
Huh?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.660
Please have a seat.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:58.890
Huh?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.370
The weather is nice. It feels good.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.430
Yeah, it's the perfect weather for sketching.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.530
We've got to thank Ms. Yoshinoya.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.200
Yeah!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.880
Ms. Yoshinoya, do you have to go
to school even on holidays?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:17.780
Yes.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:22.620
Yesterday, I got a call from a dark
lord telling me to come in.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:24.320
A dark lord?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:24.880
Dark Lord
A dark lord?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.720
Yes, his face is very thin and long.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:29.750
Pop

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:32.890
Furthermore, my parents were the
ones who answered the phone.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.530
How are you two going to spend the day?

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.930
Mid-terms are over, so we still haven't
decided what we're going to do today.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:41.840
Yeah!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:46.440
In that case, I'll tell you of the perfect
place to go to in this season.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.480
There's a wonderful shrine
near Iwakaba Station.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:57.590
On a side note, I went to Iwakaba Station to
meet a classmate from my time at Yamabuki.

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:02.660
We were in the same class and
we got along really well.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:06.960
Our teacher often said that
we were really similar.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.200
Two Ms. Yoshinoyas in one class?

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:11.640
Iwakaba Station

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.940
Iwakaba Station
Iwakaba... Iwakaba...

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.730
Iwakaba... Iwakaba...

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.440
Miya-chan, I'm surprised you
remembered about the shrine.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.310
I just forgot about it after what
she said afterwards.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:25.080
What did she say afterwards?

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.710
Wow!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.350
We've got to walk up these.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.800
It looks like I'm going to get muscle pains.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.860
Yunocchi!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.870
Let's race!

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.210
Miya-chan...

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:55.970
All right!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.570
One...

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.190
There are a lot of steps.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.630
I'm already tired.

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:14.390
Keep it up, Yunocchi,
we're only half way there!

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:16.390
Just a little more!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:19.370
Umm, that was 450, so...

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:25.500
451, 452, 453, 454...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.470
Say, Yunocchi, what time is it now?

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:29.940
Huh?

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.440
Right now, it's 1:25.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.050
Tak Tak Tak Tak Tak Tak Tak Tak

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.690
Miya-chan, that was mean!

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.470
We finally made it!

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.560
Yeah, it's a pretty wonderful shrine, isn't it?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.340
Then, let's get started!

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:02.310
Are you young ladies sketching?

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.310
Yes.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.080
Take as long as you like.

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.710
Thank you very much!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:08.950
Hold on, young lady!

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.460
There's a dip over there, so be careful.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.750
Oh my, thank you.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.250
Hello, young lady.

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:19.460
You seem to be blessed with some
sunny May weather today.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.330
Yes, it's very pleasant.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.800
Is he the reason Ms. Yoshinoya
finds this shrine wonderful?

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:28.660
Ah!

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.470
Mm!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:36.280
Say, why do guardian lions exist?

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:41.490
Hmm, perhaps they protect the
shrine from misfortune.

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:44.050
Despite that, they seem weak, don't they?

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.110
They should be...

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.660
...more like this.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.530
Miya-chan, if they looked like that,
no one would come around.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:59.470
Let's do our own things until three o'clock.

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:01.230
Okay, thanks.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:05.310
I don't really like people watching
me when I draw. Sorry.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:06.800
It's all right.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.750
What a wonderful place.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:25.820
I'm sure that Ms. Yoshinoya wanted
to show us this scenery.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.970
Miya-chan?

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:37.840
I got the feeling that someone
was watching me.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.170
I wonder if it was just my imagination?

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:46.680
Umm, did you want something?

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:48.080
Amazing!

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.510
Can I have that picture?

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.280
Huh? If you want it.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.330
Are you a genius?

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.490
What?!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.670
Umm... Uhh...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.910
Can I watch you draw from here?

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.440
Huh?

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:22.650
Sure, go right ahead.

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:24.320
All right!

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.160
Faculty Room

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.010
It's supposed to be a holiday.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.980
I reminded you all yesterday to turn it in!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.210
I just couldn't remember!

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.220
You knew it was something you had to turn in,

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:55.340
so why did you wait until the
last minute to do it?!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.020
Because...

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:12.530
Sorry to keep you waiting, Miya-chan.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.040
Ah, Yunocchi, did you draw anything?

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:19.740
Yeah! I'd like to draw a little more
once I get back home.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:22.440
Did something good happen?

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.720
So, that's what happened.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:30.880
Yeah, she seemed incredibly happy.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:35.650
I'm sure that something about the
picture touched her heart.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.530
Huh? No way!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.290
It was just a picture of the scenery.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:44.660
But she's probably the same
girl who hung around me.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:47.600
She didn't ask me for my picture.

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:48.860
Huh?

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.540
Stretch

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.480
It was just a picture of the scenery.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.820
I'm not even that good.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:08.050
But I guess it's true that my
picture made her smile.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.760
Oh, a text message. It's from Yuno.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.600
Huh? Koujigaoka Station?!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.810
Huh? The last stop?

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:29.750
Miyako was sleeping and Yuno didn't
hear the announcement.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.270
I hear you didn't realize you reached
the last stop. What happened?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.340
I was zoning out.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.750
Come on in.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:52.150
Oh, no. I'm going to go to my room
and continue sketching.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:53.150
Is that so?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.020
Then, I'll bring you some snacks later.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.220
Okay, thank you very much.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.350
All right!

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:11.890
They're cute, so I could never
get myself to use them.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.640
There sure are all sorts.

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.230
Did you ever collect them?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.610
No, they're so small, I'd lose them.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.240
I can't erase anything with them either.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.840
You're right.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:27.810
Weren't they only popular until we
were in the fourth grade?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.490
Yunocchi?

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.230
I ended up buying too many snacks!

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:45.910
I told you it was too much.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:50.000
Why didn't you try harder to stop me?!

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:55.610
Oh, landlady.

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.580
Hey!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.050
Hello.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.620
This is perfect.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:02.060
Here!

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:03.390
Here!
Do you know where this apartment is?

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.380
This is...

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.930
I think it's right around the corner that way.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.420
Thank you.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:11.790
What's this for?

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.360
A part-time job.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.520
A part-time job?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.610
Yeah, I take pictures of
apartments and condominiums.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.240
Oh?

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.910
Come on, stand next to each other.
I'll take your picture.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.340
That camera belongs to the company
you work for, doesn't it?

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.880
You sure are sharp.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:31.220
See you later.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:33.980
I've got to take three more pictures
before the end of the day.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.350
Landlady?

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:38.460
Huh?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:43.160
Umm, Room 203 doesn't appear to be locked.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.390
Unlocked? Room 203?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.100
Is that so?

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:51.270
There's nothing important in there,
so there's no need to lock it.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:53.760
B-But if something happens...

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:57.110
You think so? You're worrying too much.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.410
This is Hidamari Apartments.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:01.750
See you later!

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:03.910
Hey, Landlady!

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.780
What? Are you worried about that?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.020
Can we come in?

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:16.660
Come right in.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.420
Here are some snacks for you.

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.300
Yeah!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.110
I bought too much.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.650
I don't think that's a problem!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:42.280
We ran into the landlady outside.

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:46.620
The landlady? Have you ever
met her, Miya-chan?

00:14:46.890 --> 00:14:47.790
Never.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.020
Me too.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.430
Say, why does the landlady...

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:50.930
Come on, let's eat!

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.430
Potato Chips
Come on, let's eat!

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:52.800
Come on, let's eat!

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.170
This is butter natto flavored.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.100
You haven't tried this yet, have you?

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.040
It's a challenge from Hiro.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.740
I can't even imagine what that tastes like.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.120
It's delicious.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.140
Really?

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.400
Wow, it's actually sticky.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.170
Isn't it delicious?

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.630
Yeah, the aftertaste lingers.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.960
So, how was the shrine?

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:38.080
It was a very wonderful place.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.980
Especially the priest.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.840
So, how was the shrine?

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:47.020
It must have been difficult
to climb those steps.

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:50.890
Yeah, we were panting all
the way to the shrine.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:55.960
You've got to massage that,
or you'll get muscle pains tomorrow.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.850
I don't want muscle pains.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.430
Miya-chan, you went up the
steps two at a time.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:02.470
Are you all right?

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:03.800
I'm fine!

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:08.330
The stairs were tough, but because of that,
the scenery was very beautiful.

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:09.110
Yeah!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:09.680
Oh?
Yeah!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:10.240
Oh?

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.680
Incoming Call: Naoi

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:15.500
Oh, excuse me for a second. It's my editor.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:22.580
Yes, good work.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.090
Yes... Yes...

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:27.150
Really?

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.260
It's a lucky chocolate!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:32.170
You're right! It's the first time I ever saw one!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.630
You're amazing!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.370
Wow, it really does exist!

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.740
Is that a winner?

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:42.730
Yes, if you get this chocolate, the feelings
for the person you love will be mutual.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.710
You did it, Yunocchi!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.680
Yeah! But with whom?

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:52.420
Wait a second. I bought these chocolates.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:53.810
Which means...

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.420
In this case, whose is it?

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:04.860
Let's just ignore it.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.340
S-Sae...

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.480
Oh, Natsume.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:26.020
My club activities just finished.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.710
I just happened by.

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.620
That's right! By chance!

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:30.920
It happened by chance!

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:34.120
You don't have to keep repeating yourself.
I get it already.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:38.790
As long as you understand.
Well then, I'll see you around!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.700
What's her problem?

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.740
I wanted to show it to Sae, at least.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.950
Is it that rare?

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.610
There's only a 1 in 5,000
probability you'll find one.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.210
I hope we get one again.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.080
I'm back.

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:02.980
Welcome back.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.450
Sae, you missed out.

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.720
We found a lucky chocolate.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:11.660
That's amazing! Show it to me.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.260
You ate it?

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:15.930
It melted.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.770
Oh, I ran into Natsume downstairs.

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:24.000
Oh, did you talk about anything?

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:28.080
Nothing in particular.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.170
I see.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.280
She's really strange.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.120
What are you doing?

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.700
Ms. Kuwahara, you're late!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:52.230
Sorry! What happened?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.170
Here's your work.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:55.310
Huh?

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:58.240
Aren't we supposed to turn this in tomorrow?

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.850
That's right!

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:06.410
It's a holiday, but the principal won't let
me leave unless I turn it in today!

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:10.680
So, I figured I could get it done faster
if we worked together.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:14.960
What?!

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:18.490
But it's a holiday!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:22.090
Faculty Room

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:30.930
Ms. Yoshinoya, you are just unbelievable.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.750
I'm stuffed.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.550
Yeah, I really got hooked on butter natto.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.190
I'll buy it again.

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:42.250
We can hold off on dinner until later, can't we?

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.980
Oh, I'm having only jelly for
dinner again tonight.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:48.460
What? Hiro, you only eat jelly for dinner?

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.630
Lately, that's all she's been eating.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:52.860
Don't you get sick of eating jelly every day?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.760
A little.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:57.160
That's why I do all sorts of things with it.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:02.480
I put toppings on it.
Like condensed milk, or fresh cream.

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:04.270
You pour it on.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:10.580
If you put that much condensed milk on it,
it will defeat the purpose of eating diet jelly.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.780
You have a lot left, don't you?

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.350
Give them to me if you don't need them!

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:18.180
It's only a matter of time.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:20.790
Jeez!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.400
There's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:24.590
That's right.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.320
That's not true.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.900
When I think about how we'll be switching
uniforms soon, I feel depressed.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:35.430
I'm jealous that you don't have
to worry about dieting.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:39.940
What did you two sketch today?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.380
Scenery!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.620
Same here.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:45.520
We were sketching on our own.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:49.250
A little girl asked me if she could
have a picture I drew.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.290
That's right.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:56.890
That girl hung around me,
but never asked me for mine!

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:01.790
The picture was still incomplete,
but she looked so happy to have it.

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:03.160
Oh?

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:07.900
I want to see the picture that
Yunocchi gave away.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:12.640
Anyway, show us the picture that the
girl wasn't interested in, Miyako.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.820
Miya-chan, that's impressive.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:19.940
Indeed.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.210
Well...

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.320
My picture wasn't this detailed.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:30.920
Even so, your picture had something
that touched her heart.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.330
Yuno, you must have drawn
a wonderful picture.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.500
That's not true.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:41.370
No, I think it's great to be able
to make people happy.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:56.650
I hope I don't get muscle pains tomorrow.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:03.830
I wonder if I'll be able to make someone
happy with my pictures someday?

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:05.720
Right?

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:09.770
May 27 The End To Be Continued

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:25.520
An unknown world stretched out

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:31.250
Connecting, endless connecting threads

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:38.300
An upside down world is pretty fun

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:44.100
Connecting, never-ending threads

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:50.170
You are smiling somewhere today

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:55.750
I will run all night until the day we meet again

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:57.350
Run all night

00:22:57.350 --> 00:23:00.420
The record of a resounding shooting star

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:03.760
Your singing voice

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:06.830
Touches my heart

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:10.100
A sky full of shooting stars

00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:13.230
The record of a shining shooting star

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:16.440
Your whispering voice

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:19.870
Leads me through space

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:22.740
A song about shooting stars

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:26.280
I can't hear them

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:30.220
I can't reach them

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:34.780
The footsteps I'm looking for

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:41.410
Preview

00:23:41.410 --> 00:23:44.680
Preview
This is off topic, but have any of
you ever eaten cat food?

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:45.680
Preview
No way!

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:47.420
Preview
I never have, but why do you ask?

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.550
Preview
Actually, I wanted to use it
as an idea for a novel.

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:51.350
Preview
Even I've never done that.

00:23:51.350 --> 00:23:53.660
Preview
Unfortunately, I've never done that either.

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:54.720
Preview
I have.

00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:57.830
Preview
It has no taste, but it's pretty
good with a little soy sauce.

00:23:57.830 --> 00:23:59.360
Preview
What?!

00:23:59.360 --> 00:23:59.630
Preview

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:05.070
Preview
The next episode is
"March 16 ~ 23, Mellow Tuna Flavor"

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:06.440
Preview
We'll be waiting at Hidamari Apartments.

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:08.270
Preview
Be sure to tune in!

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:09.740
Preview
